  "name": "Example: \n                    Separating a Square Root Into a Quotient of Two Square Roots",
  "problem": "Express $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{7}}$ as the quotient of two radicals.",
  "worked_solution": "Applying the quotient rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{7}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{7}} .\n$$",
